/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 102 0 R
/E (For example, when Shield AI detects a risk signal, it can automatically provide context to Investigator AI to begin a verification process, all while MindCare AI monitors if the resulting workload is creating undue stress for the user. This level of synchronization ensures that the organization moves as a single, intelligent unit. The kernel also manages the "Zero-Trust" security architecture, ensuring that every data movement is encrypted, auditable, and compliant with institutional rules.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
